{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "trace-lit-collection-001",
    "name": "TraceLit API",
    "description": "Intelligent Academic Literature Assistant with Sentence-Level Verified Attribution.\n\nBase URL: {{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}\n\n## Quick Start\n1. Import this collection and the TraceLit_Environment.\n2. Set `base_url` to your server (default: http://localhost:8000).\n3. Create a session — the response `id` auto-populates `{{session_id}}`.\n4. Upload PDFs, then chat, compare, analyse, and export.\n\n## Real-Time Progress (WebSocket)\n1. Call **Get WebSocket URL** (Sessions section) to get the ws:// URL\n2. Connect using a WebSocket client (JavaScript, Socket.io, native WebSocket, etc.)\n3. Receive real-time progress: paper_progress, paper_completed, paper_failed",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "{{base_url}}"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_prefix",
      "value": "{{api_prefix}}"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Returns service health status and active LLM provider availability."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sessions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Session",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('session_id', jsonData.id);",
                  "    console.log('session_id set to: ' + jsonData.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"My Research Session\",\n  \"description\": \"Exploring NLP papers on transformer architectures\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new research session. Both `title` and `description` are optional."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Sessions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions"]
            },
            "description": "List all sessions ordered by most recently updated."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Session",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get session details by ID."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Rename Session",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Updated Session Title\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Rename a session. `title` is required (1–200 chars)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Session",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Delete a session and all associated data (papers, chunks, vectors, exports)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get WebSocket URL",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/ws-url",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}", "ws-url"]
            },
            "description": "Get the WebSocket URL for real-time paper processing progress updates.\n\nResponse includes:\n- `websocket_url`: Full WebSocket URL (ws:// or wss://)\n- `session_id`: Session ID\n\nUse the `websocket_url` to connect a WebSocket client for real-time progress events:\n- {\"type\": \"paper_progress\", \"paper_id\": \"...\", \"progress\": 0.5}\n- {\"type\": \"paper_completed\", \"paper_id\": \"...\"}\n- {\"type\": \"paper_failed\", \"paper_id\": \"...\", \"error\": \"...\"}"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Papers",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upload Papers (PDF)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.paper_ids && jsonData.paper_ids.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('paper_id', jsonData.paper_ids[0]);",
                  "        console.log('paper_id set to: ' + jsonData.paper_ids[0]);",
                  "        if (jsonData.paper_ids.length > 1) {",
                  "            pm.environment.set('second_paper_id', jsonData.paper_ids[1]);",
                  "            console.log('second_paper_id set to: ' + jsonData.paper_ids[1]);",
                  "        }",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "files",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": "",
                  "description": "Select 1–7 PDF files to upload"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/papers",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}", "papers"]
            },
            "description": "Upload 1–7 PDF files to a session. Files are validated (type, size ≤ 50 MB) then queued for async processing."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Papers",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/papers",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}", "papers"]
            },
            "description": "List all papers in a session with their processing status."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Paper",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/papers/{{paper_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}", "papers", "{{paper_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get a single paper's details including metadata, status, and processing progress."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Paper",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/papers/{{paper_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}", "papers", "{{paper_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Delete a paper and its associated chunks/vectors."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Chat",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Send Message (Sync)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"query\": \"What are the main contributions of the uploaded papers?\",\n  \"stream\": false\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/chat",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}", "chat"]
            },
            "description": "Send a query and receive a verified response. Uses RAG retrieval + HAVF verification pipeline. Set `stream: false` for a synchronous JSON response."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Send Message (Stream / SSE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "text/event-stream"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"query\": \"Summarize the key findings across all papers.\",\n  \"stream\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/chat",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}", "chat"]
            },
            "description": "Send a query with streaming enabled (`stream: true`). Returns Server-Sent Events (SSE). Note: Postman has limited SSE support — you may see the raw event text."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Chat History",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/chat/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}", "chat", "messages"]
            },
            "description": "Get all messages in a session's chat history (user queries + assistant responses with HAVF verification results)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Comparison",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Compare Papers",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"paper_ids\": [\n    \"{{paper_id}}\",\n    \"{{second_paper_id}}\"\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/compare",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}", "compare"]
            },
            "description": "Compare 2–7 papers side-by-side. Returns a structured comparison of their methodologies, findings, and contributions."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Paper Contributions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/compare/contributions/{{paper_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": [
                "sessions",
                "{{session_id}}",
                "compare",
                "contributions",
                "{{paper_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Extract structured contributions (objectives, methods, findings, etc.) from a single paper."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Export",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Export Session (PDF)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('export_filename', jsonData.filename);",
                  "    console.log('export_filename set to: ' + jsonData.filename);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"format\": \"pdf\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/export",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}", "export"]
            },
            "description": "Export a chat session to PDF format. Returns a download URL."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Export Session (Excel)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('export_filename', jsonData.filename);",
                  "    console.log('export_filename set to: ' + jsonData.filename);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"format\": \"excel\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/export",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}", "export"]
            },
            "description": "Export a chat session to Excel (.xlsx) format. Returns a download URL."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Download Exported File",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/export/download/{{export_filename}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": [
                "sessions",
                "{{session_id}}",
                "export",
                "download",
                "{{export_filename}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Download a previously exported file by filename. Responds with the binary file (PDF or Excel)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Analysis",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Paper Keywords",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/analysis/keywords/{{paper_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": [
                "sessions",
                "{{session_id}}",
                "analysis",
                "keywords",
                "{{paper_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Extract keywords with relevance scores from a single paper."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Gap Analysis",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/analysis/gaps",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}", "analysis", "gaps"]
            },
            "description": "Run gap analysis across all papers in the session. Returns identified themes and underexplored areas."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Literature Review",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/analysis/review",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["sessions", "{{session_id}}", "analysis", "review"]
            },
            "description": "Generate a mini literature review from all papers in the session using LLM."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verification",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Verify Text Against Papers",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"text\": \"Transformer models have significantly improved NLP tasks by using self-attention mechanisms. BERT introduced bidirectional pre-training for language understanding.\",\n  \"paper_ids\": [\n    \"{{paper_id}}\"\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/verify",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["verify"]
            },
            "description": "Verify arbitrary text (e.g., your own notes or claims) against indexed papers. Returns per-sentence HAVF verification results with confidence scores."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "WebSocket",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Paper Processing Progress (WS)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ws_base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/ws/{{session_id}}",
              "host": ["{{ws_base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"],
              "path": ["ws", "{{session_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "WebSocket endpoint for real-time paper processing progress updates.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Use the 'Get WebSocket URL' endpoint in Sessions section to obtain the correct ws:// URL before connecting.**\n\nMessages received on successful connection:\n- {\"type\": \"paper_progress\", \"paper_id\": \"...\", \"progress\": 0.5}\n- {\"type\": \"paper_completed\", \"paper_id\": \"...\"}\n- {\"type\": \"paper_failed\", \"paper_id\": \"...\", \"error\": \"...\"}\n\nSend heartbeat:\n- Send 'ping' to receive 'pong' heartbeat acknowledgment\n\n**To Connect:**\n1. Call GET /sessions/{session_id}/ws-url to get the WebSocket URL\n2. Use a WebSocket client (not HTTP) to connect to the returned URL\n3. Listen for progress messages in real-time"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
